        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI sales lead analyst.\n\nAnalyze the following customer lead.\n\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}\n\nReturn:\n- category\n- intent\n- priority: High, Medium, or Low\n- lead_score: integer from 0 to 100\n- summary: one short sentence\n- recommended_action: one short sentence\n\nScoring guide:\n80-100 = strong buying/demo/project intent\n50-79 = possible interest or needs follow-up\n0-49 = weak, unclear, spam, or non-sales enquiry\n\nDo not invent information that is not present in the lead.\n\nReturn only valid JSON using exactly these keys:\n{\n  \"category\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"priority\": \"\",\n  \"lead_score\": 0,\n  \"summary\": \"\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "name": "lead_analysis",
              "schema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"category\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"intent\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"priority\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"]\n    },\n    \"lead_score\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 100\n    },\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"recommended_action\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"category\",\n    \"intent\",\n    \"priority\",\n    \"lead_score\",\n    \"summary\",\n    \"recommended_action\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
              "strict": true
            }
          }
        }
